<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Smith Barney starts Nuveen funds.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Smith Barney starts Nuveen funds.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney initiated coverage of three Nuveen mutual funds with outperform-medium risk.</p>
<p>-- the three include: Nuveen Premium Income Municipal Fund Inc, Nuveen Premium Income Municipal Fund Inc II and Nuveen Premium Income Municipal Fund 4.</p>
</text>
